Give intelligent pets a unicorn horn. They will use it when necessary. An
uncursed one is sufficient, it always works.

Giving pets items is easiest with a dead-end corridor like
---+
.A@|
---+
Drop the item and then displace your pet on it and wait until it picks up the
item.

A variation is:
---+
.@(|
---+
Magic-whistle your pet until it's on the item, then wait.

The former method works best if you have more than one pet.

Covetous pets (i.e. master/arch-lich) work somewhat differently, of course :)

Keep in mind pets only pick up the top item of a pile (e.g. if they drop
something on top of the unicorn horn, take it away).

